# Clean Architecture - Frontend

## Architecture Layers

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│           UI (Components)           │  ← React Components, Pages
├─────────────────────────────────────┤
│         Application (Hooks)         │  ← Custom Hooks, State
├─────────────────────────────────────┤
│          Domain (Models)            │  ← Types, Interfaces, DTOs
├─────────────────────────────────────┤
│      Infrastructure (Services)      │  ← API Client, External Services
└─────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## Mapping to Folder Structure

| Layer | Folder | Responsibility |
|-------|--------|----------------|
| UI | `features/*/pages/`, `components/` | Rendering, user interaction |
| Application | `features/*/hooks.ts` | Business logic, orchestration |
| Domain | `shared/dtos/`, `shared/enums/` | Models, interfaces, rules |
| Infrastructure | `services/`, `features/*/api.ts` | External communication |

## Data Flow

```
UI Component
    ↓ calls
Custom Hook (useFeature)
    ↓ uses
API Service (feature/api.ts)
    ↓ fetches via
API Client (services/api-client.ts)
    ↓ returns
Typed DTO
    ↑ updates
React Query Cache
    ↑ renders
UI Component
```

## Practical Example

```tsx
// 1. Domain - shared/dtos/professional.dto.ts
interface ProfessionalDTO {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  specialty: string;
}

// 2. Infrastructure - features/professionals/api.ts
export const professionalsApi = {
  getAll: () => apiClient.get<ProfessionalDTO[]>('/professionals'),
  getById: (id: string) => apiClient.get<ProfessionalDTO>(`/professionals/${id}`),
};

// 3. Application - features/professionals/hooks.ts
export function useProfessionals() {
  return useQuery({
    queryKey: ['professionals'],
    queryFn: professionalsApi.getAll,
  });
}

// 4. UI - features/professionals/pages/ProfessionalsPage.tsx
export function ProfessionalsPage() {
  const { data, isLoading } = useProfessionals();
  return <ProfessionalList items={data} />;
}
```

## Dependency Rule

```
UI → Application → Domain ← Infrastructure
         ↓            ↓
      Domain       Domain
```

- **UI** only imports from Application and Domain
- **Application** only imports from Infrastructure and Domain
- **Infrastructure** only imports from Domain
- **Domain** does NOT import from any other layer
